Subject: Re: Help needed on #95010

On Mon, 25 June 2001, Craig Small wrote:
> On Tue, Jun 19, 2001 at 03:13:31PM +0200, Samuel Tardieu wrote:
> > could one of you have a look at 95010? I cannot find an Alpha machine
